    "name": "Convert File Server API",
    "description": "# High-Performance File Conversion API\nConvert Word, Excel, PowerPoint, HTML, PDF and Image formats with our powerful file conversion service.\nWe support more than 200 file types.\n\nContact Support:\n Email: support@convertapi.com",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
